{"code":"fa-IR","name":"Persian","native":"فارسی","variant":"Farsi","badge":"فا","tts":"fa-IR","rtl":true,"about":"Spoken Tehran Persian, written the way people text it. The diet card uses formal written Persian.","sheets":[{"id":"C1","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Keep it alive","blurb":"The lines that rescue any conversation. You’ll use these every day, everywhere.","items":[{"id":"c1.1","t":"نمی‌فهمم.","say":"ne-mee-FAH-mam","en":"I don't understand.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.2","t":"نمی‌دونم.","say":"ne-mee-DOO-nam","en":"I don't know.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.3","t":"یه لحظه، لطفاً.","say":"ye LAH-ze, LOT-fan","en":"One moment, please.","ctx":["work","shops","phone"],"tags":"wait hold on sec moment"},{"id":"c1.4","t":"میشه تکرار کنید؟","say":"MEE-she tek-RAAR ko-NEED","en":"Can you say that again?","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"repeat again pardon what"},{"id":"c1.5","t":"آروم‌تر، لطفاً.","say":"AA-room-tar, LOT-fan","en":"Slower, please.","ctx":["travel","chat"],"tags":"slow slowly speak"},{"id":"c1.6","t":"«…» به فارسی چی میشه؟","say":"… be faar-SEE chee MEE-she","en":"What’s “…” in Persian?","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"word translate"}]},{"id":"C2","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"React like you belong","blurb":"Short reactions that make you sound fluent while you listen.","items":[{"id":"c2.1","t":"حتماً.","say":"HAT-man","en":"Sure. / Of course.","ctx":["work","shops","chat"],"tags":"yes ok okay sure course"},{"id":"c2.2","t":"دقیقاً.","say":"da-GHEE-ghan","en":"Exactly. / Right.","ctx":["work","chat"],"tags":"yes right correct agree"},{"id":"c2.3","t":"فکر کنم.","say":"FEKR ko-nam","en":"I think so.","ctx":["work","chat"]},{"id":"c2.4","t":"واقعاً؟","say":"VAA-ghe-an","en":"Really?","ctx":["chat"]},{"id":"c2.5","t":"مشکلی نیست.","say":"mosh-ke-LEE nist","en":"No problem. / No worries.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"welcome fine ok"},{"id":"c2.6","t":"عالیه!","say":"AA-lee-ye","en":"Great! / How nice!","ctx":["chat","family"],"tags":"cool awesome nice"}]},{"id":"C3","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Frames","blurb":"Phrases with a blank. Drop in any word you know and you have a new sentence.","items":[{"id":"c3.1","t":"{x} کجاست؟","say":"{x} ko-JAAST","en":"Where is {x}?","ctx":["travel","toilets"],"tags":"where find","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bathroom","fits":["place","work"]},{"id":"c3.2","t":"{x:acc} می‌خوام.","say":"{x:acc} mee-KHAAM","en":"I want {x}.","ctx":["food","shops"],"tags":"want like would order get","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"coffee","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.3","t":"{x} دارید؟","say":"{x} daa-REED","en":"Do you have {x}?","ctx":["shops","food"],"tags":"have any got there","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"water","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.4","t":"{x:acc}، لطفاً.","say":"{x:acc}, LOT-fan","en":"{x}, please.","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"please give","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bill","fits":["thing","work"]},{"id":"c3.5","t":"باید {x}.","say":"BAA-yad {x}","en":"I have to {x}.","ctx":["work","plans"],"tags":"must need got","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"leave"},{"id":"c3.6","t":"می‌تونم {x}؟","say":"mee-too-NAM {x}","en":"Can I {x}?","ctx":["work","travel"],"tags":"can may could allowed","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"comein"}]},{"id":"W","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"work","title":"Work: Slack & meetings","blurb":"Mostly lines you already know, plus two new ones and some words for your blanks.","items":[{"id":"w.1","t":"بررسی می‌کنم.","say":"bar-ra-SEE mee-ko-NAM","en":"I'll check it.","tags":"look into get back"},{"id":"w.2","t":"جلسه دارم.","say":"ja-la-SE daa-RAM","en":"I have a meeting.","tags":"busy call"}],"core":["c1.3","c1.1","c1.2","c1.4","c2.1","c2.2"],"words":["meeting","file","screen","message","tomorrow"]},{"id":"T1","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Eating out","blurb":"Your frames do most of the ordering. A few new lines and some food words.","diet":true,"items":[{"id":"t1.1","t":"تنده؟","say":"TOON-de","en":"Is it spicy?","tags":"hot chili"},{"id":"t1.2","t":"بدون پیاز، لطفاً.","say":"be-DOO-ne pee-YAAZ, LOT-fan","en":"Without onion, please."},{"id":"t1.3","t":"چی پیشنهاد می‌کنید؟","say":"chee pish-na-HAAD mee-ko-NEED","en":"What do you recommend?"},{"id":"t1.4","t":"گوشت نمی‌خورم.","say":"goosht ne-mee-kho-RAM","en":"I don't eat meat.","tags":"vegetarian vegan meat"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.4","c3.3","c1.1"],"words":["water","coffee","bill","menu","beer","this"]},{"id":"T2","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Shopping & money","blurb":"Want, have, one moment: all core. Four new lines.","items":[{"id":"t2.1","t":"چنده؟","say":"CHAN-de","en":"How much is it?","tags":"price cost how much"},{"id":"t2.2","t":"فقط دارم نگاه می‌کنم.","say":"fa-GHAT DAA-ram ne-GAAH mee-ko-NAM","en":"I'm just looking."},{"id":"t2.3","t":"اینو برمی‌دارم.","say":"EE-no bar-mee-daa-RAM","en":"I'll take it."},{"id":"t2.4","t":"با کارت میشه حساب کرد؟","say":"baa KAART MEE-she he-SAAB kard","en":"Can I pay by card?","tags":"credit card cash pay"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.3","c1.3"],"words":["this","bag"]},{"id":"T3","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Getting around","blurb":"Ask with your core frame, then understand the answer.","items":[{"id":"t3.1","t":"دوره؟","say":"DOO-re","en":"Is it far?"},{"id":"t3.2","t":"فرودگاه، لطفاً.","say":"fo-rood-GAAH, LOT-fan","en":"To the airport, please. (taxi)","tags":"taxi cab driver"},{"id":"t3.3","t":"چپ · راست · مستقیم","say":"chap · raast · mos-ta-GHEEM","en":"left · right · straight on","hear":true,"tags":"directions"}],"core":["c3.1","c1.5","c1.4"],"words":["station","airport","hotel"]},{"id":"T4","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Toilets, help & signs","blurb":"Ask with your core frame. New: a few emergency lines and the signs you’ll see.","signs":true,"items":[{"id":"t4.1","t":"کمک!","say":"ko-MAK","en":"Help!","tags":"emergency"},{"id":"t4.2","t":"دستمال توالت نیست.","say":"dast-MAA-le too-aa-LET nist","en":"There's no toilet paper."},{"id":"t4.3","t":"حالم خوب نیست.","say":"HAA-lam khoob nist","en":"I don’t feel well.","tags":"ill unwell doctor"},{"id":"t4.4","t":"لطفاً آمبولانس خبر کنید.","say":"LOT-fan aam-boo-LAANS kha-BAR ko-NEED","en":"Please call an ambulance.","tags":"emergency doctor"}],"core":["c3.1","c3.4","c1.1"],"words":["bathroom","pharmacy","hospital"]},{"id":"F","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"family","title":"Family & small talk","blurb":"Reactions carry the conversation. Four new lines to start one.","items":[{"id":"f.1","t":"خوشبختم.","say":"khosh-BAKH-tam","en":"Nice to meet you."},{"id":"f.2","t":"اهل کجایید؟","say":"AH-le ko-JAA-yeed","en":"Where are you from?"},{"id":"f.3","t":"چی کار می‌کنید؟","say":"chee-KAAR mee-ko-NEED","en":"What do you do (for work)?"},{"id":"f.4","t":"خیلی خوشمزه‌ست!","say":"KHEY-lee khosh-ma-ZE-ast","en":"It's delicious!"}],"core":["c2.1","c2.4","c2.6","c2.3"]},{"id":"B1","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Hello & basics","blurb":"Greetings, yes and no, please and thanks.","items":[{"id":"b1.1","t":"سلام.","say":"sa-LAAM","en":"Hello.","tags":"hi hey"},{"id":"b1.2","t":"صبح بخیر.","say":"sobh be-KHEYR","en":"Good morning."},{"id":"b1.3","t":"حالتون چطوره؟","say":"haa-le-TOON che-TO-re","en":"How are you?"},{"id":"b1.4","t":"بله. · نه.","say":"BA-le · na","en":"Yes. · No."},{"id":"b1.5","t":"لطفاً.","say":"LOT-fan","en":"Please."},{"id":"b1.6","t":"مرسی. · ممنون.","say":"MER-see · mam-NOON","en":"Thank you."},{"id":"b1.7","t":"ببخشید.","say":"be-bakh-SHEED","en":"Sorry. / Excuse me.","tags":"excuse me pardon apologize"},{"id":"b1.8","t":"خداحافظ.","say":"kho-daa-HAA-fez","en":"Goodbye.","tags":"bye"}]},{"id":"B2","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Numbers","blurb":"Enough for prices, times and phone numbers.","items":[{"id":"b2.1","t":"یک · دو · سه","say":"yek · do · se","en":"1 · 2 · 3"},{"id":"b2.2","t":"چهار · پنج · شش","say":"cha-HAAR · panj · shesh","en":"4 · 5 · 6"},{"id":"b2.3","t":"هفت · هشت · نه","say":"haft · hasht · noh","en":"7 · 8 · 9"},{"id":"b2.4","t":"ده · بیست · صد","say":"dah · beest · sad","en":"10 · 20 · 100"},{"id":"x.B21","t":"۱ ۲ ۳ ۴ ۵ ۶ ۷ ۸ ۹ ۱۰","say":"yek … dah","en":"Persian digits 1–10: on prices, plates and signs"}]},{"id":"B3","mode":"basic","kind":"blueprint","title":"Blueprint","blurb":"How the language works, on one page. Spot the pattern; skip the rulebook.","items":[{"id":"b3.1","t":"سیب قرمزه.","say":"seeb ghermez-E","en":"The apple is red.","note":"no “the” · -ه (-e) = is, in speech"},{"id":"b3.2","t":"سیب رو می‌خورم.","say":"seeb ro mee-kho-RAM","en":"I eat the apple.","note":"verb last · رو (ro) marks “the” object · -am = I"},{"id":"b3.3","t":"سیب رو خوردم.","say":"seeb ro khor-DAM","en":"I ate the apple.","note":"past stem + -am"},{"id":"b3.4","t":"می‌خوام سیب رو بخورم.","say":"mee-KHAAM seeb ro be-kho-RAM","en":"I want to eat the apple.","note":"want + be- verb"},{"id":"b3.5","t":"سیب می‌خوری؟","say":"seeb mee-kho-REE","en":"Do you eat apples?","note":"the voice goes up"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bathroom","t":"دستشویی","say":"dast-shoo-EE","en":"the bathroom","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"toilet restroom washroom wc loo"},{"id":"pharmacy","t":"داروخانه","say":"daa-roo-khaa-NE","en":"the pharmacy","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"drugstore chemist medicine"},{"id":"hospital","t":"بیمارستان","say":"bee-maa-res-TAAN","en":"the hospital","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"doctor emergency"},{"id":"station","t":"ایستگاه","say":"eest-GAAH","en":"the station","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"train metro subway"},{"id":"airport","t":"فرودگاه","say":"fo-rood-GAAH","en":"the airport","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"flight plane"},{"id":"hotel","t":"هتل","say":"ho-TEL","en":"the hotel","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"room stay"},{"id":"water","t":"آب","say":"aab","en":"water","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink"},{"id":"coffee","t":"قهوه","say":"ghah-VE","en":"a coffee","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"cafe drink"},{"id":"bill","t":"صورتحساب","say":"soo-rat-he-SAAB","en":"the bill","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"check pay receipt"},{"id":"menu","t":"منو","say":"me-NOO","en":"the menu","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"food order"},{"id":"beer","t":"آبجو","say":"aab-JO","en":"a beer","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink alcohol"},{"id":"this","t":"این","say":"een","en":"this one","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"that one","acc":"اینو","accSay":"EE-no"},{"id":"bag","t":"کیسه","say":"kee-SE","en":"a bag","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"plastic bag"},{"id":"meeting","t":"جلسه","say":"ja-la-SE","en":"the meeting","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"call standup zoom"},{"id":"file","t":"فایل","say":"faa-YEL","en":"the file","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"document doc"},{"id":"screen","t":"صفحه","say":"saf-HE","en":"the screen","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"share screen"},{"id":"message","t":"پیام","say":"pa-YAAM","en":"the message","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"slack text dm"},{"id":"tomorrow","t":"فردا","say":"far-DAA","en":"tomorrow","kind":"time"},{"id":"leave","t":"برم","say":"be-RAM","en":"go","kind":"verb","tags":"leave go"},{"id":"comein","t":"بیام تو","say":"bee-AAM too","en":"come in","kind":"verb","tags":"enter"},{"id":"pay","t":"پول بدم","say":"pool be-DAM","en":"pay","kind":"verb","tags":"card cash"}],"diet":{"title":"حساسیت غذایی · لطفاً بخوانید","ask":"آیا این غذا هیچ‌کدام از این مواد را دارد؟","askEn":"Does this dish contain any of these?","thanks":"خیلی ممنون!","note":"","options":{"peanut":{"label":"Peanut allergy","t":"به بادام‌زمینی حساسیت شدید دارم. نمی‌توانم بادام‌زمینی یا روغن بادام‌زمینی بخورم.","en":"I have a severe peanut allergy. I can't eat peanuts or peanut oil."},"shellfish":{"label":"Shellfish allergy","t":"به غذاهای دریایی حساسیت شدید دارم (میگو، خرچنگ، صدف).","en":"I have a severe shellfish allergy (shrimp, crab, shellfish)."},"gluten":{"label":"No gluten","t":"نمی‌توانم گلوتن بخورم (گندم، جو، چاودار).","en":"I can't eat gluten (wheat)."},"vegetarian":{"label":"No meat or fish","t":"گیاه‌خوار هستم. گوشت، مرغ و ماهی نمی‌خورم.","en":"I don't eat meat, chicken or fish."},"pork":{"label":"No pork","t":"گوشت خوک نمی‌خورم.","en":"I don't eat pork."}}},"signs":[{"t":"سرویس بهداشتی","en":"Restrooms"},{"t":"آقایان · بانوان","en":"Men · Women"},{"t":"خروج · ورود","en":"Exit · Entrance"},{"t":"فشار دهید · بکشید","en":"Push · Pull"},{"t":"خروج اضطراری","en":"Emergency exit"}]}